<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5717] The to_date function is not aligned with SparkSQL. When converting to a time format such as yyyyMMdd, the result of the query hitting the snapshot is incorrect</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5717</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The to_date function is not aligned with SparkSQL.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When converting to a time format such as yyyyMMdd, the result of the query hitting the snapshot is incorrect&#65307;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
